    "name": "Your Majesty",
    "steam_appid": 2699740,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699740/extras/9b5484ac58d83cedca02efe6af4e36de.avif?t=1740118839\" width=600 height=80 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Choice!</strong></h2>Do you want to experience managing one dynasty after another, where every decision you make will affect the fate of your nation? Every time you review a memorial, it may affect <strong><u>Finance, Technology, Army, Civilization</u></strong> these four resources. Of course, some events are interconnected, so pay attention to their long-term impact on your country.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699740/extras/e76152db4e33dd5db74592949c23c108.avif?t=1740118839\" width=600 height=80 /></span><br><br></li><li> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Events!</strong></h2>You will start your day\u2019s work at 5 a.m., reviewing memorials and admiring the sky until 11 p.m. There will always be urgent events happening. Will you prioritize them or\u2026 ignore them? Of course, you can also reject everything and be an emperor who doesn\u2019t think! Maybe laziness is your weapon.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699740/extras/da128db19e908f41c76f42c7668ad8a2.avif?t=1740118839\" width=600 height=80 /></span><br><br></li><li> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Dynasty!</strong></h2>Every 20 years, your name will be inherited by the next generation. Try to pass it on!<br><strong><u>Your Majesty!</u></strong></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699740/extras/9b5484ac58d83cedca02efe6af4e36de.avif?t=1740118839\" width=600 height=80 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Choice!</strong></h2>Do you want to experience managing one dynasty after another, where every decision you make will affect the fate of your nation? Every time you review a memorial, it may affect <strong><u>Finance, Technology, Army, Civilization</u></strong> these four resources. Of course, some events are interconnected, so pay attention to their long-term impact on your country.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699740/extras/e76152db4e33dd5db74592949c23c108.avif?t=1740118839\" width=600 height=80 /></span><br><br></li><li> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Events!</strong></h2>You will start your day\u2019s work at 5 a.m., reviewing memorials and admiring the sky until 11 p.m. There will always be urgent events happening. Will you prioritize them or\u2026 ignore them? Of course, you can also reject everything and be an emperor who doesn\u2019t think! Maybe laziness is your weapon.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699740/extras/da128db19e908f41c76f42c7668ad8a2.avif?t=1740118839\" width=600 height=80 /></span><br><br></li><li> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Dynasty!</strong></h2>Every 20 years, your name will be inherited by the next generation. Try to pass it on!<br><strong><u>Your Majesty!</u></strong></li></ul>",
